                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** or **^^Prayer^^** ability for a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy **^^Wizard^^** and ^^**Priest^^** within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 2+, for the rest of the phase:
• Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for the targets.
• Each time any of the targets fails to cast a spell or chant a prayer, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
