                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly non-**^^Hero Nighthaunt^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+:
• If the target is damaged, **Heal (X)** the target, where **X** is an amount equal to the roll.
• If the target is not damaged, return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to X, where X is an amount equal to the roll.</characteristic>
