                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">After that **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved, roll a dice. You can spend 1 **rage dice**. If you do:
• Add 1 to the roll.
• If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7.
On a 3+, this unit can move a distance up to its Move characteristic. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
